{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Directorate of Education — Certificate & Integrity Chain",
    "description": "مجموعة Postman لـ APIs الشهادة، الوثيقة النهائية، وسلسلة النزاهة (QR).\n\n**المتغيرات:**\n- `baseUrl` — عنوان السيرفر (افتراضي http://localhost:4000)\n- `token` — Bearer token للمواطن/المالك\n- `transactionId` — معرّف المعاملة المكتملة\n\n**ترتيب الاستخدام المقترح:**\n1. GET certificate — بيانات الطباعة + QR payload\n2. (الفرونت يولّد PDF)\n3. POST final-document — رفع PDF النهائي\n4. GET final-document — التحقق من الحفظ\n5. GET integrity-chain — سلسلة التواقيع (يتطلب auth)\n6. GET/POST integrity-chain/verify — تحقق عام (QR — بدون auth)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "transactionId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "head_hash",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "genesis_hash",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Certificate — الشهادة",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET بيانات الشهادة للطباعة (transaction_history + QR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/{{transactionId}}/certificate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "transaction", "{{transactionId}}", "certificate"]
            },
            "description": "يجمع transaction_history + integrity_chain.qr_payload + final_document.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer (مالك المعاملة فقط)\n**الحالة:** completed فقط\n\nللموظف: GET /api/workflow/transactions/{transactionId}/certificate"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "APIs بيانات الشهادة قبل/أثناء توليد PDF من الفرونت"
    },
    {
      "name": "Final Document — الوثيقة النهائية",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST رفع وحفظ PDF النهائي",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "ملف PDF النهائي المُولَّد من الفرونت (إلزامي)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "qr_payload",
                  "value": "{\"v\":1,\"tx\":1,\"genesis\":\"\",\"head\":\"\",\"links\":0}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "JSON string — snapshot QR عند الطباعة (اختياري)",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/{{transactionId}}/final-document",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "transaction", "{{transactionId}}", "final-document"]
            },
            "description": "يرفع PDF النهائي بعد توليده من الفرونت.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer (مالك المعاملة)\n**Body:** multipart/form-data\n- file (required)\n- qr_payload (optional JSON string)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET جلب الوثيقة النهائية المحفوظة",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/{{transactionId}}/final-document",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "transaction", "{{transactionId}}", "final-document"]
            },
            "description": "يرجع مسار/بيانات PDF النهائي المحفوظ.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer (مالك المعاملة)"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "رفع وجلب الوثيقة النهائية بعد توليد PDF من الفرونت"
    },
    {
      "name": "Integrity Chain — سلسلة النزاهة",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET سلسلة التواقيع + QR payload",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/{{transactionId}}/integrity-chain",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "transaction", "{{transactionId}}", "integrity-chain"]
            },
            "description": "يعرض signature ledger + qr_payload.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer (مالك المعاملة)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Verify — عام (QR scan)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/{{transactionId}}/integrity-chain/verify?head_hash={{head_hash}}&genesis_hash={{genesis_hash}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "transaction", "{{transactionId}}", "integrity-chain", "verify"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "head_hash",
                  "value": "{{head_hash}}",
                  "description": "اختياري — من QR"
                },
                {
                  "key": "genesis_hash",
                  "value": "{{genesis_hash}}",
                  "description": "اختياري — من QR"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "تحقق عام من سلسلة التواقيع — **لا يتطلب تسجيل دخول**.\n\nQuery params اختيارية للمقارنة مع QR."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Verify — عام (body)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"head_hash\": \"{{head_hash}}\",\n  \"genesis_hash\": \"{{genesis_hash}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/{{transactionId}}/integrity-chain/verify",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "transaction", "{{transactionId}}", "integrity-chain", "verify"]
            },
            "description": "تحقق عام — **لا يتطلب auth**.\n\nBody اختياري:\n- head_hash\n- genesis_hash"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "سلسلة النزاهة والتحقق العام (QR)"
    }
  ]
}
